## Coverage

Post Office schemes (PPF, SSY, NSC, SCSS, KVP, MIS, TD, MSSC), bank FD/RD/savings
(SBI, PNB, BOB, BOI, Union Bank), pension & insurance (APY, NPS, PMJJBY, PMSBY),
tax (income tax, GST, capital gains, TDS), salary (in-hand, HRA, EPF, gratuity),
loans (EMI, home loan prepayment), investments (SIP, step-up SIP, SWP, lumpsum,
XIRR, CAGR, retirement, compound/simple interest, inflation), and a bank balance missed-call directory.

